'''Divine Beam''' is a [[debuff]] from the monster skill of the same name. It is used by [[High Templar Avarius|Innocence, God-Emperor of Eternity]].

The debuff has two icons. The main one lasts longer and does not disappear immediately upon leaving the beam.
==See also==
* {{stl|Divine Flare}}, monster skill that also deals burning damage. The beam is vertical instead.
* {{il|Divine Ire}}, player skill that deals physical and lightning damage by default

